  _motive: From reading the letters it can be noted that Antonio was told to commit
    the murder for his actual employers.
  _means: He had plenty of cleaning materials and plenty of opportunities to poison
    the drink of the performer with the strychnine.
  _opportunity: He said in the first conversation that I had with him that he was
    cleaning the back bathrooms. But from checking his cart he has not cleaned anything
    since he clocked in today. He also said that someone called him outside but even
    then, this does not explain what he did the rest of the time.
